  "extraction_notes": "The figure shows a catalyst screening table for amide bond formation between 2-phenylbutyric acid and benzylamine using catalyst 2 (5 mol%) with various additives. Catalyst '2' is referenced but its structure is not shown in this figure. MPO = 2-hydroxypyridine N-oxide (morpholine pyridone oxide), DMAPO = 4-(dimethylamino)pyridine N-oxide, PPYO = 2-phenylpyridine N-oxide. I've used common structures for these additives. Yields marked as <5 are recorded as yield_note only."
